{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1757073250\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.webm?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.mp4?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Idle by Design</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the game run while you work, study, or doomscroll. Your heroes will patrol, battle, and level up all on their own \u2014 no punishment, no pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a tiny fantasy outpost existing quietly in the corner of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.poster.avif?t=1757073250\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.webm?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/f1a0d201ad9eed5481c83adc1321e464.mp4?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional Depth, Cozy Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you do feel like checking in, there\u2019s loot to sort, gear to equip, and new heroes to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no penalties or stress \u2014 but you can swoop in at any point and spend some time optimizing equipment so that your Rogue gets braver and your Knight faster... or was it the other way around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.poster.avif?t=1757073250\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.webm?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ce34382b31707816c1b88f5f9c82a933.mp4?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Desktop Companions with Personality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These aren\u2019t just idle units \u2014 they\u2019re tiny pixel people with thoughts, quirks, and the occasional banter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They might chat about the monsters they\u2019re fighting, celebrate a level-up, or just complain that their boots are wet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/9811df22a6f5e7b3f6c8cfbfc0131346.poster.avif?t=1757073250\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/9811df22a6f5e7b3f6c8cfbfc0131346.webm?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/9811df22a6f5e7b3f6c8cfbfc0131346.mp4?t=1757073250\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing World In Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an evolving game. Planned updates include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 More unique heroes  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mounts to ride  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Personal housing you can decorate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make their little corner of the world even cozier with every update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897350?t=1757073250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897350?t=1757073250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/b840e578d613d666c918956450cca37c0770cba9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757073250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/b840e578d613d666c918956450cca37c0770cba9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757073250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3914120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute pixel heroes that live on your desktop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idlewood Outpost is an idle desktop pet game where a band of pixel RPG heroes guard your taskbar, collect loot, and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897350/extras/ab98794c484123d98eb23950bd61c1b2.poster.avif?t=1757073250\" width=720 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st